# Purpose:
# This script implements two complementary sensitivity analyses requested by
# the reviewers.
#
# Reviewer #1:
#   Test whether the main inference is robust when observed seasonal species
#   composition and CPUE are retained, but functional profiles are randomly
#   reassigned among species.
#
# Reviewer #2:
#   Test whether the main inference depends on the number and composition of
#   traits used to construct the functional space.
#
# Main required objects:
#   Mat2_use   = community matrix, seasons x species, with CPUE values
#   coord_use  = PCoA coordinates used in the main FD analysis
#   FD_all     = observed FD results from the main analysis
#
# Additional object required for Reviewer #2:
#   trait_df   = trait table, with one row per species and one column containing
