# Reviewer #2: Trait-set sensitivity analysis
#
# Objective:
# Test whether the main null-model inference depends on the number and
# composition of traits used to construct the functional space.
#
# Input object required:
#   Land_traits
#
# Expected structure of Land_traits:
#   - One row per species
